ansport","base_path":"/government/organisations/department-for-transport","content_id":"4c717efc-f47b-478e-a76d-ce1ae0af1946","details":{"acronym":"DfT","brand":"department-for-transport","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/654bbccfe2e16a000d42abe1/s960_dft-gmh-960.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/654bbccfe70413000dfc4a51/s300_dft-gmh-960.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Department<br/>for Transport"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Department for Transport","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/department-for-transport","withdrawn":false}],"roles":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/minister-for-the-civil-service","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/minister-for-the-civil-service","base_path":"/government/ministers/minister-for-the-civil-service","content_id":"846a7351-c0f1-11e4-8223-005056011aef","details":{"body":"<p>The Minister for the Civil Service is responsible for regulating the <a rel=\"external\" href=\"http://www.civilservice.gov.uk/\">Civil Service</a>.</p>\n\n<p>The <a rel=\"external\" href=\"http://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/1992/61/contents\">Civil Service (Management Functions) Act of 1992</a>, allows the Minister for the Civil Service to delegate power to other ministers and devolved administrations.</p>\n\n<p>This role was created in 1968 and is always held by the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/prime-minister\">Prime Minister</a>.</p>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":3,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2022-09-28T11:40:15Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Minister for the Civil Service","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/minister-for-the-civil-service","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-work-and-pensions","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-work-and-pensions","base_path":"/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-work-and-pensions","content_id":"845e6272-c0f1-11e4-8223-005056011aef","details":{"body":"<p>The Secretary of State has overall responsibility for the business of the department, including the Departmental Strategy, planning and performance, reporting and governance requirements. They have direct responsibility for departmental expenditure.</p>\n\n<p><abbr title=\"Department for Work and Pensions\">DWP</abbr> is responsible for the administration of the State Pension and working age benefits system, providing support to:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>people of working age</li>\n  <li>employers</li>\n  <li>pensioners</li>\n  <li>families and children</li>\n  <li>disabled people</li>\n</ul>\n\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":15,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2022-11-14T08:51:13Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Secretary of State for Work and Pensions","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-work-and-pensions","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-transport","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-transport","base_path":"/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-transport","content_id":"845e6453-c0f1-11e4-8223-005056011aef","details":{"body":"<p>The Secretary of State has overall responsibility for all Department for Transport business, including: </p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>overarching responsibility for the departmental portfolio and oversight of the ministerial team </li>\n  <li>delivering the transport priorities of the government: making transport cheaper, greener, and more reliable </li>\n  <l